Dear Students,


We are pleased to inform you that *Unthinkable Solutions LLP *again wishes
to hire students of *B.Tech-(CS,DS, CY, AI&ML) & MCA Batch 2027**. *Student=
s
are advised to go through the description carefully and provide
their nomination for participation by filling the Google Form.


*Dates of drive*: Coming few days in Virtual or Physical mode. (As per
company=E2=80=99s discretion)


*Note: Students are required to provide the nominations before the
deadline. Post-deadline no entries will be considered for the
drive. Students who wish to take a dream slot are required to email the
dream slot application email on * *placement@jietjodhpur.ac.in
<placement@jietjodhpur.ac.in>*   * and fill the Google form before the
deadline.**(**Deadline: September 21, 2026 till 9:00 AM**).*


*Eligibility Criteria:*

# B.Tech-(CS,DS, CY, AI&ML) & MCA Batch 2027

# Zero Backlog.

# CAT -  *I* and *II*   .
# As per career preference form


*NOTE:  **I* and *II* category students can apply to companies in their own
category or lower category, provided they meet the company's above specific
eligibility criteria. Meaning *I* category students can apply for *II* &
*III* category companies and *II* category students can apply for
*III* category
companies.*As we have one student one placement policy* - give your
nomination only after going through the job profile carefully and if you
wish to join the company post selection.


*List of eligible students for the Google form is attached herewith.*


*About the Company: Unthinkable Solutions LLP *is a leading product
engineering firm, known for building bespoke digital platforms for
prominent Indian brands such as Nykaa, Souled Store, RBI, Chalo, Pine Labs,
and Samsung. We are on a mission to build the best digital platforms for
global tech-driven companies.


*Website: *https://www.unthinkable.co/


*Job Role:* Sales & Business Development


*Detailed Job Description is attached herewith*


*Job Description: *This is a golden opportunity for students to join our
dynamic Sales & Business Development team, where we foster a culture that
encourages learning, growth, and collaboration. Candidates will get an
opportunity to develop their skills in sales, business development, client
interaction, and lead generation.


*Skills Required: *Good Communication Skills, Strong Interpersonal Skills,
Logical Thinking, and Interest in Sales & Business Development.


*What You'll Do:*

- Conduct market research to identify potential clients and industry trends=
.

- Analyze data on market conditions, competition, and customer preferences.

- Prepare comprehensive market analysis reports and presentations.

- Support the sales team in crafting compelling proposals.

- Collaborate with sales and technical teams to refine strategies.

- Conduct cold calling to generate new leads and set up meetings.

- Maintain a database of potential clients and market intelligence.

- Participate in sales meetings and brainstorming sessions.

- Follow up with potential leads to gather additional information.


*Who Will Be a Good Fit*

- Strong analytical and communication skills.

- Highly organized and able to manage multiple tasks.

- Proactive and interested in sales and market research.

- Familiarity with IT services is a plus.

- Proficient in Microsoft Office and market research tools.


